    {
      "id": "contribution",
      "topic": "technical_innovation",
      "basis": "interpretation",
      "text": "相对直接mouse_event与SendKeys，增量是把最小化、激活、坐标口径和诊断统一封装，给调用方保留requested/applied证据。它是输入可靠性适配层，不提供OCR或业务验收。",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "2026-10-21-02-github-1422121370-root-source"
